      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. it just feels like i'm running on empty. i'm looking after my mom and it's never ending. no matter how much i do, it's never enough and she's only getting worse. i'm just so tired of waking up every morning and realizing i have to do it all over again. it feels like a loop i can't escape.",
